review:
Good trial-and-error 2D-Platform with calm music and 31 levels (the levels from 25 to 30 are quite hard, especially level 29 that required some fine luck).
This game rewards you with some good-looking achievements that you can use to personalize your own Steam profile.

Achievements you can unlock:
- all the English alphabet letters;
- all the Japanese hiragana characters (also the characters "ゑ we" e "ゐ wi", obsolete in Modern Japanese);
- the kanji 道 (street, way) and the kanji 禪 (Zen, silent meditation);
- numbers from 1 to 30;
- 2 other achievements.

For just 0,79€ (0,39€ on sale) is worth it.
I recommend you to buy it if you want to have a hard time with some tricky platform, and collect some amazing hiragana characters.
